  "assertions": [
    "Receive evidence requires exactly one NUL-containing address among2008/2010/2017 and no extras; ErrField remains, no ErrUnsupported is added, and the path extends to the selected leaf. Build/Send and mixed errors retain the bare group path.",
    "Complete root and ancestor scans share counters. The closed SMS group has14 known unique vendor10415 fields,6 required children and5 four-byte scalar kinds. Nested interfaces stay opaque after trusted decoder validation; later scalar and request semantics remain later.",
    "Owned36+align4(n)-byte quotes preserve the complete original selected AVP and padding without other address/client/interface data. Source, quote and full-answer bounds are independent; no allocation precedes budget checks.",
    "All optional subsets, three-field combinations, exact/one-less budgets, scalar widths, flags, duplicates, original padding, child order and ownership are tested. ClientAddressWire2018 and non-address blob NUL bytes stay opaque.",
    "TCP/TLS ordinary and emergency acceptance covers three fields across IEC, INITIAL, TERMINATION, direct debit, balance and refund with exact envelopes, non-delivery, held charges, follow-up, short-budget closure and retirement.",
    "Mixed values/extras and earlier structural/interface/subscription errors preserve first failure. Reordering SMS and malformed MMS groups changes the selected error consistently with wire order.",
    "Full dual-module pure/race and twenty-round selected regressions use fixed inputs. One affected counted fuzz target runs locally; all17 run in hosted CI.",
    "Pure Go, application-owned persistence, module requirements, immutable tags, frozen rc.1 receipts and all24 completion conditions remain unchanged."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Other existing conditional/value rules (including request relations, MMS field exclusions and SMS C-string constraints), mixed values/omissions and unreviewed group/cardinality/domain/handshake/header mappings remain separate. Keep safe close when no reviewed diagnostic applies.",
    "The changed development checkout needs a future immutable version and fresh core/adapter/cold-install acceptance. The verified rc.1 receipt remains valid only for its frozen commits.",
    "External private-template/target-recovery/role evidence and declared long-soak/saturation/tenant/mixed-transport acceptance remain separate."
